			'Cybersécurité : Top 500 sur Root-Me parmi environ 300 000 participants - 7 500 points.',
		],
		languages: [
			{ name: 'Français', level: 'Langue maternelle' },
			{ name: 'Anglais', level: 'C1 - TOEIC 885' },
			{ name: 'Italien', level: 'B1' },
		],
	},
	en: {
		updated: 'Last updated in September 2026',
		summary:
			'Big Data and Artificial Intelligence engineer, ranked 1st out of 204 students in my Master’s year, with hands-on experience building data pipelines, predictive models, internal data tooling, and AI-enabled systems in an industrial environment. Seeking a permanent role to deliver reliable data and machine learning solutions with measurable business value.',
